      "Language": "ger",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Low back pain disorders of the elderly can potentially be caused by sacral insufficiency fractures due to osteoporosis, radiation necrosis or seldom malignant processes. In our institution an increasing numbers of patients suffering from osteoporotic sacral insufficiency fractures could recently be observed. In a case report study clinical symptoms, diagnostic procedures as well as therapeutic options are discussed."},
